File "layout_any_return_effect_float64_result.ml", lines 23-25, characters 2-32:
23 | ..match g () with
24 |   | x -> x
25 |   | effect E, k -> continue k ()
Error: The result of a match or try expression with effect handlers
       must have a value layout.
       The layout of float# is float64
         because it is the unboxed version of the primitive type float.
       But the layout of float# must be a value layout
         because it's the result of a match or try expression with effect handlers.
